---------------------------------------

Upstream   kilo, by Salvatore Sanfilippo (antirez)
           https://github.com/antirez/kilo (master, commit
           323d93b29bd89a2cb446de90c4ed4fea1764176e)
Licence    BSD-2-Clause. Copyright (c) 2016, Salvatore Sanfilippo
           <antirez at gmail dot com>. The full text is in
           tracks/kilo/LICENSE, which comes with the project's files at
